      "line": 14,
      "category": ["structured-concurrency-violation", "global-scope-leak"],
      "hint": "launch inside suspend fun without coroutineScope { } — result is returned before children finish"
    }
  ],
  "must_not_flag": [],
  "notes": "Result-race: the suspend fun returns while children still write to `result`, and the injected scope may outlive the caller."
